      "page_title": "Never-Awaited Coroutines",
      "blocks": [
        {
          "type": "heading",
          "text": "1. What the warning means",
          "ink": "green"
        },
        {
          "type": "bullets",
          "items": [
            "`RuntimeWarning: coroutine 'fetch' was never awaited`",
            "Emitted when a ==coroutine object== is GC'd **unrun**",
            "Almost always a missing `await`",
            "Fires at __GC time__: it can show up far from the bug",
            "It may even be blamed on a **different** test"
          ],
          "style": "dot",
          "frame": "dashed",
          "ink": "green"
        },
        {
          "type": "code",
          "lang": "python",
          "lines": [
            "async def save(db):",
            "    db.insert(row)  # coroutine!",
            "    return 'ok'     # never ran",
            "# should be: await db.insert(row)"
          ],
          "note": "coroutine is created but never run"
        },
        {
          "type": "heading",
          "text": "2. Find where it was created",
          "ink": "blue"
        },
        {
          "type": "bullets",
          "items": [
            "The hint says: \"Enable ==tracemalloc== to get the allocation traceback\"",
            "tracemalloc records allocation stacks. `25` = **frame depth**",
            "More memory, slower: enable it only while debugging",
            "Debug mode sets `sys.set_coroutine_origin_tracking_depth`",
            "That gives a creation traceback **without** tracemalloc"
          ],
          "style": "dot",
          "frame": "dashed",
          "ink": "blue"
        },
        {
          "type": "table",
          "headers": [
            "Switch",
            "Gives"
          ],
          "rows": [
            [
              "`python -X tracemalloc=25`",
              "alloc traceback"
            ],
            [
              "`PYTHONTRACEMALLOC=25`",
              "alloc traceback"
            ],
            [
              "`-X dev` / `debug=True`",
              "origin traceback"
            ]
          ],
          "frame": "dashed"
        },
        {
          "type": "code",
          "lang": "text",
          "lines": [
            "$ python -X tracemalloc=25 a.py",
            "RuntimeWarning: coroutine",
            "  'insert' was never awaited",
            "Object allocated at:",
            "  File \"a.py\", line 2",
            "    db.insert(row)"
          ],
          "note": "points at the exact line that created it"
        },
        {
          "type": "heading",
          "text": "3. Task warnings",
          "ink": "purple"
        },
        {
          "type": "table",
          "headers": [
            "Message",
            "Meaning",
            "Fix"
          ],
          "rows": [
            [
              "Task was destroyed but it is pending!",
              "GC'd **mid-flight**",
              "keep a strong ref"
            ],
            [
              "Task exception was never retrieved",
              "error lost",
              "await or `.exception()`"
            ]
          ],
          "frame": "dashed"
        },
        {
          "type": "code",
